            "Surface strength, deck openings, and fragile areas assessed",
            "Fall-protection system, anchors, rescue route, and boundaries verified",
            "Skylights, holes, edges, and lower-level exposure controlled",
            "Wind, rain, ice, heat, lightning, and visibility reviewed",
            "Hoisting, material loading, dropped-object, and public zones controlled",
            "Hot-work, kettle, torch, fuel, and fire-watch controls verified",
            "Electrical lines, rooftop equipment, and temporary power controlled",
            "Silica, asbestos, lead, fumes, and SDS routes addressed",
            "Daily housekeeping and loose-material securement maintained"
